    "created_at": "2025-04-23T16:19:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-24T11:10:39Z",
    "body": "Chromium does seem to throw the wrong exception here. It's the allocation of `ArrayBuffer` that fails and that should lead to a `RangeError` exception, per JS.\n\nBased on https://commits.webkit.org/293416@main WebKit appears to throw a `TypeError` in the string case. Need to investigate if that's the way to go.",
